  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7513801",
      "subQuestName": "返回天蛇船",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "751380101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "751380101": {
            "id": "751380101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}，你没事吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380102"
            ]
          },
          "751380102": {
            "id": "751380102",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380103"
            ]
          },
          "751380103": {
            "id": "751380103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#真是太好了，{NICKNAME}在那个…呃，好难解释，总之就是{M#他}{F#她}在梦里看到你和奇怪的人在一起。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380104"
            ]
          },
          "751380104": {
            "id": "751380104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你在天蛇船上有遇到什么奇怪的人吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380105"
            ]
          },
          "751380105": {
            "id": "751380105",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀…呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380106"
            ]
          },
          "751380106": {
            "id": "751380106",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸？那到底是有还是没有啦？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380107"
            ]
          },
          "751380107": {
            "id": "751380107",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呜…呀！呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380108"
            ]
          },
          "751380108": {
            "id": "751380108",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哇，完全搞不懂你想说什么啦！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380109"
            ]
          },
          "751380109": {
            "id": "751380109",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "#既然{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}没事就好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380110"
            ]
          },
          "751380110": {
            "id": "751380110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "是哦，不过玻娜呢，玻娜去哪啦？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380111"
            ]
          },
          "751380111": {
            "id": "751380111",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380112"
            ]
          },
          "751380112": {
            "id": "751380112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "难道你们走散了吗？还是说玻娜她真的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380113"
            ]
          },
          "751380113": {
            "id": "751380113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "或许玻娜只是故事中的角色。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380114"
            ]
          },
          "751380114": {
            "id": "751380114",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯…你说的也是呢，普通人是没办法活几百年的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380115"
            ]
          },
          "751380115": {
            "id": "751380115",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "但至少我们完成了她未完的冒险。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380116"
            ]
          },
          "751380116": {
            "id": "751380116",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "是哦，我们也答应了她，要好好宣传这段冒险经历。等大伙都知道我们找到了天蛇船，玻娜也会成为大名鼎鼎的冒险家吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380117"
            ]
          },
          "751380117": {
            "id": "751380117",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "接下来就该…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380118"
            ]
          },
          "751380118": {
            "id": "751380118",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "接下来就该去火山找「那个人」…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380119"
            ]
          },
          "751380119": {
            "id": "751380119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "把事情弄清楚了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380120"
            ]
          },
          "751380120": {
            "id": "751380120",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这样说来，那个家伙该不会就是「盗火贤者」吧？一路上都是他留下来的讯息，我是越来越好奇了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380121"
            ]
          },
          "751380121": {
            "id": "751380121",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "而且那家伙还说自己会假扮成不同的身份，就算遇到了我们也不一定能认得出来吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380122"
            ]
          },
          "751380122": {
            "id": "751380122",
            "speakerId": 14662,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380123"
            ]
          },
          "751380123": {
            "id": "751380123",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#果然你也很好奇吧，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380124"
            ]
          },
          "751380124": {
            "id": "751380124",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#既然信物也已经找齐了，接下来我们就和{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}一起去火山吧，解开所有的秘密，然后帮{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}解除诅咒。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "751380125"
            ]
          },
          "751380125": {
            "id": "751380125",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对不起喔，玻娜，「通牒金盘」我们要先带走咯。等到我们把所有事情都搞清楚之后，再把一切告诉你吧！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
